{"id":253,"slug":"253-object-create-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Prototype","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Object.create() hoạt động như thế nào?","question_en":"How does Object.create() work?","answer_vi":"`Object.create(proto)` tạo object mới với prototype là `proto`. Object con dùng được method từ `proto` qua prototype chain.\n\n```javascript\nconst parent = { greet() { return 'Hi!'; } };\nconst child = Object.create(parent);\nchild.greet(); // 'Hi!' — inherited\nchild.hasOwnProperty('greet'); // false — not own\n\n// Object.create(null) — object không có prototype\nconst dict = Object.create(null);\n'toString' in dict; // false — thật sự sạch\n```","answer_en":"`Object.create(proto)` creates a new object whose prototype is `proto`. The child can use methods from `proto` via the prototype chain.\n\n```javascript\nconst parent = { greet() { return 'Hi!'; } };\nconst child = Object.create(parent);\nchild.greet(); // 'Hi!' — inherited\nchild.hasOwnProperty('greet'); // false — not own\n\n// Object.create(null) — object with no prototype\nconst dict = Object.create(null);\n'toString' in dict; // false — truly clean\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>Object.create(proto)</code> tạo object mới với prototype là <code>proto</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Object con dùng được method từ <code>proto</code> qua prototype chain.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const parent = { greet() { return 'Hi!'; } };\nconst child = Object.create(parent);\nchild.greet(); // 'Hi!' — inherited\nchild.hasOwnProperty('greet'); // false — not own\n\n// Object.create(null) — object không có prototype\nconst dict = Object.create(null);\n'toString' in dict; // false — thật sự sạch\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" 